{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022081312380-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022123325\"/><p>荃灣中心有人燒炭。</p><p>荃灣有人燒炭。今日(22日)早上7時51分，一名姓李(33歲)女子在荃景圍103號荃灣中心杭州樓一單位房間內燒炭，其家人發現報案求助。救護員接報趕至，經檢驗證實事主已氣絕，人員於現場沒有檢獲遺書，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:41:02.549817+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:13:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:38:01.368781+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:38:04.451453+00:00","content_hash":"4c3db0427194381f248a6a14c8b825bfa3ba271480e2777b3d601c1d9f7560c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}